<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total $58.0 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total $58.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two promissory note tenders totalling A$58.0 million were handled by the Australian commercial paper market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>McDonald's Corp's Australian unit made the larger issue, selling A$30 million of its one-month paper at two basis points over the corresponding bank bill mid rate.</p>
<p>A A$25 million Keystart Bonds issue made on Monday also settled today.</p>
<p>Discount securities dealers said market turnover continued to improve over last week's levels as players returned to the market.</p>
<p>At 0014 GMT (11.14 a.m.) March bill futures were down 0.01 to 94.14.</p>
